{
  "id": "1KI.9",
  "number": "9",
  "bookId": "1KI",
  "reference": "1 Sugoodiga 9",
  "verseCount": 28,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "9",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "1KI 9"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "9",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "ASEETA goohiimsa geaw Sulemani gicha",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 9:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean iinea ghwaahiit Sulemani deekta gheeda NG'UTAMIIDA ea gheeda sugoocheanda ea haleanjeeda ghayi gasa gwasin Sulemani, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.9.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.9.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 9:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ghwahidu NG'UTAMIIDA heeda Sulemani deaba iyeenya, gawuurji gidaghayi hitaayda headaanyi aba Gibeoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.9.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.9.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 9:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwayeesha NG'UTAMIIDA, “Naayiinyi musiischoadaang'u irukwiisi madeedeanyu; neabadiischeesi gheawi ghayi ideasiin, ak ghaayiinyi gheawungeasu damanda manda muudeanooda; ak gheanyangeasu ea gurooroodeanyu gaygwanda hoowa damanyoojiga sean. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.9.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.9.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 9:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ang'iing'i, inyas gaybeawana madeedeanyu, gawuurji gidabeeda ghweandaang'u was Dawdi, aba guroorooda miy ea doobiiwnata, nea gisineadi gidaghayi earukuneey, giing'ooydi diigheanyeekeasu ea deaweedajeegeasu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.9.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.9.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 9:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak abeeda gaydeamajeek hoorgeadaang'u bea gheambalmeeda Israeli damanda manda muudeanooda, gawuurji gidaghayi earukusiindi ghweandaang'u was Dawdi, nea geayeeshi, ‘Mayramwasa siichea goopteadawa hoorgeeda Israeli.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.9.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.9.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 9:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak inyas ginung'waadi eanooda geeshteanyu, ang'iing'i ghana diibigaagu, ak ea moang'waanyi diigheanyeekeasu ea huumeanyeeka ghayi aayiinyi madeadeang'wa, ak gooweayi agadiyeesiina sanaamajeega nea ghoabwachi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.9.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.9.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 9:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak abeeda gaydahuta Israeli aba jeeda ng'eanyiida ghayi aadawji saawa; ea gheeda ghayi eabadiischeesi aba gheawungeasu gaydahuteawa gheanyangeasu; nea fuga Israeli gayghoah ghwasiildeanga ea ng'asheega giing'weaka aba madeeda buuneeda sean. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.9.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.9.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 9:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gheawi gayghoah gidaghaambiidaat; gilinyoo ghwala murdeeda gayghahamng'eanyi, ak gabara reari; nea gwayi, ‘Ghwasaan NG'UTAMIIDA gwahindunu ng'eanyiini ea gheawi?’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.9.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.9.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 9:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gaygwayi, ‘Aba gideaba gwajakta NG'UTAMIIDA, was ASEETA nyaawa, ghayi aruuna ghweaniga nyaawa jeeda ng'eanyiida Misri, ak gagadiiyeesa aseecheeka suuk, hean ghabwat nea gagadiiyeesa saawa; ak ghamneawa NG'UTAMIIDA nijaksa munyasnacheeka badahuuka nyaawa.’”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.9.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.9.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Sulemani gwasin neajeeda sea Hiramu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 9:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.9.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.9.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 9:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba muudeanooda gweaydeaba diktam, was gweanyeeka deasa Sulemani geal iyeenya, gheeda NG'UTAMIIDA ea gheeda sugoocheanda, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.9.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.9.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 9:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak Hiramu sugoocheanda Diro ea ninyaksa Sulemani beehajeega gubooyeeka ea mareamboojiga ea dahaabu ea ghwahita mooneeda gasa, sugoocheanda was Sulemani ghoadaw Hiramu mujiinaji diktam aba jeeda ng'eanyiida Galilaya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.9.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.9.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 9:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ama ng'ata nea gwaleabu Hiramu ng'eanyiida Diro ghwadaah mujiinajeega adaw Sulemani, ea moohoosana, hean gwayi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.9.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.9.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 9:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Suh mujiinajeega uurjiini gil igoonyeaniin, orjeeda giyeanya?” Hean gaguura ng'eanyiita Gabuli ea ghoah ghamneawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.9.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.9.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 9:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea Hiramu ea niijeaksa heeda sugoocheanda dalaantaji bughala ea diktam bea dahaabu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.9.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.9.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Sulemani gwoahada baruureegaaschi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 9:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.9.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.9.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 9:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak nih ea iita fuga sin gadiyeeda uurda gil, nung' sugoocheanda was Sulemani ghwadeas gheeda NG'UTAMIIDA ea gheanyi ea gheeda Milo ea ghamarda Yerusalemu ea Hasori ea Megido ea Geseri ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.9.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.9.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 9:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "(Farao was sugoocheanda Misri ea nidiyeada ak ghaghas Geseri aba ng'ata ghaghwarda aba beasta, nea ninuuseada fuga Ganaani abiita jeeda mujiini, ak ghoadayda ghoah haleanjeeda geajalda aba heeda hudaanyi was gatmooda Sulemani; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.9.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.9.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 9:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hean gabiikta Sulemani ghwadeas Geseri) ea heeda duukusa ng'eanyi bea Bet-horoni ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.9.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.9.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 9:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ea Baalati ea Damani mida dareapcheeda, aba jeeda ng'eanyiida Yuda, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.9.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.9.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 9:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ea mujiinajeega sean siitiiwiisa haleanjeeda mideawa Sulemani bea faraasajeega, ea gilinyoo gagasa Sulemani ghwadeas aba Yerusalemu, ea Lebanoni, ea jeeda ng'eanyiida sean ambali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.9.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.9.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 9:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Fuga sean siipuut gaba eemoojiga Amori, ea Hiti, ea Berisi, Hafiti ea Yebusi mawoosa eemeeda fuga Israeli ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.9.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.9.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 9:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ea jeacheenga nyaawa siipuut nea niisha saawa aba ng'eanyiida, saawa abeeda fuga Israeli mahuuyda goosha, Sulemani ghwanung' ghoah soomjooga gadiyeeda uurda, bwak ea ghoah ghamneawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.9.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.9.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 9:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak aba fuga Israeli, Sulemani mwanung' ghoah soomjooga; ghwanung' ghoah shirikara, ea fugaaschi hees, ea shirikarajeega hees, ea fuga hees manmani maleambooda, ea shirikarajeega mutukwajeega faraasi ea fugaaschi ding'iida faraasajeega. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.9.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.9.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 9:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Suh fuga hees gil miineadaysa gadiyeeda Sulemani: bughalaji muut ea haradam ea damanamughuush, miineadaysa fuga mida gadiyeeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.9.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.9.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 9:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghang'eada hudeaba Farao mujiineeda Dawdi ea ghwahita jeedeaba gheanyi ghayi deeksa Sulemani niny, ng'ata ghwadeas gheeda siguura Milo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.9.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.9.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 9:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niba samwagu aba jeeda gweayda Sulemani inyeesa ghoadayda lukghumajeega ea gea hoyyoo aba heeda wagiida ghayi deeksa NG'UTAMIIDA, ak ghaghwarda haleanjeeda sisabwa geadi aba madeeda NG'UTAMIIDA. Ng'ata ghwahit gheeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.9.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.9.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 9:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwasin Sulemani maleambajeega ng'ucheeda aba heeda siguura Esion-geberi, mida murdeeda Eloti, mida ghuuta basooda Shaamu, aba jeeda ng'eanyiida Edomu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.9.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.9.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 9:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean goojeakteawa Hiramu jeeda maleambooda fugaaschi bea gadiyeeda, fuga manmani maleambajeega nal ng'asheega jeeda basooda, sea fuga gadiyeeda bea Sulemani; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.9.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.9.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 9:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ng'ata gaweay ea ghwahita Ofiri, hean nea gweadu dahaabu, hita bughalaji ang'wan ea diktam bea dalaanta; hean gweadu heeda sugoocheanda was Sulemani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.9.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.9.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
